    {
      "file": "web/app/src/features/settings/components/model-providers/ModelProviderInstanceDrawer.tsx",
      "rule": "react-doctor/no-adjust-state-on-prop-change",
      "sourceSha256": "947152fa3285a2a075eb66343d76401431c6d986a386c665f9ba6ce60e46b028",
      "reason": "The initializer is guarded by initializedDrawerRef===drawerIdentity and does not run again for a refreshed object with the same mode/installation/instance. Close clears credential/auth/preview state; opening a new identity hydrates its own editable model/config snapshot. The cached-model effect only seeds an empty preview from asynchronously available persisted catalog; it does not continuously derive configured edits. ModelProviderInstanceDrawerContent retains editable config/secret/model/authentication drafts, with initializedDrawerRef guarded by mode/installation/instance drawerIdentity. It initializes once per identity and resets all credential/preview state when closed or switching owner; query object refresh for the same identity does not reset unsaved edits. Configured model rows and auth/cached catalog receipts remain separate state axes with dedicated child modals/cards.",
